WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.674
Teamwork requires shared outcomes, clear responsibilities and visible handovers.

00:00:03.674 --> 00:00:07.757
Dividing work does not remove the need to integrate it.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:15.105
Constructive feedback describes an observable issue and its effect, then helps the receiver identify a useful next action.

00:00:16.105 --> 00:00:22.335
They should agree on request fields, endpoint, response shape, authentication behaviour and error messages.

00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:27.675
Both pieces can work separately yet fail together if those expectations differ.

00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:31.045
What belongs in a useful handover?

00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:35.390
A handover supports the next action with concrete status and context.
